    {
      "id": "a7RpL66eZdbtK66wn3HB_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 834,
      "y": 406,
      "width": 339.9997863769531,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1637165040,
      "version": 67,
      "versionNonce": 5407504,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757091586329,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "将前端生成的字节码作为指令。然后，\n它可以对一个或多个表或索引执行作，\n每个表或索引都存储在称为 B 树的数\n据结构中。VM 本质上是字节码指令类\n型的一个大 switch 语句。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "将前端生成的字节码作为指令。然后，\n它可以对一个或多个表或索引执行作，\n每个表或索引都存储在称为 B 树的数\n据结构中。VM 本质上是字节码指令类\n型的一个大 switch 语句。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jOGMfYU0NAkjBwsL4gfnB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 674,
      "y": 544,
      "width": 482.0797119140625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 514882320,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 630155760,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757091676107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "每个 B 树由许多节点组成。每个节点的长度为一页。\nB 树可以从磁盘中检索page，也可以通过向Pager发出\n命令将其保存回磁盘。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "每个 B 树由许多节点组成。每个节点的长度为一页。\nB 树可以从磁盘中检索page，也可以通过向Pager发出\n命令将其保存回磁盘。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "las243fQflf_y6vQbdjIb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 669,
      "y": 641,
      "width": 571.2197265625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 621594384,
      "version": 42,
      "versionNonce": 1952189936,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757091732690,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "接收读取或写入数据页的命令。它负责在数据库文件中以适当\n的偏移量进行读/写。它还在内存中保留最近访问的页面的缓存，\n并确定何时需要将这些页面写回磁盘。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "接收读取或写入数据页的命令。它负责在数据库文件中以适当\n的偏移量进行读/写。它还在内存中保留最近访问的页面的缓存，\n并确定何时需要将这些页面写回磁盘。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
