    {
      "id": "-20Bird0ncZ_DuYkq5XFs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3757.999984741211,
      "y": 1407.5,
      "width": 573.879638671875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1144950373,
      "version": 46,
      "versionNonce": 518247429,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1757214696996,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在此示例中，我们将键“11”添加到树中。这将导致我们的根分裂。\n拆分内部节点时，我们必须做一些事情才能保持一切正常：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在此示例中，我们将键“11”添加到树中。这将导致我们的根分裂。\n拆分内部节点时，我们必须做一些事情才能保持一切正常：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eF77nbtEjH8wvH5CwYnpo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3759.999984741211,
      "y": 1474.5,
      "width": 597.6397094726562,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1470873253,
      "version": 101,
      "versionNonce": 1907690341,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1757214696996,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.创建一个同级节点来存储原始节点的 （n-1）/2 个键\n2.将这些键从原始节点移动到同级节点\n3.更新父节点中原始节点的关键帧，以反映其拆分后的新最大关键帧\n4.将同级节点插入父节点（可能导致父节点也被拆分）\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.创建一个同级节点来存储原始节点的 （n-1）/2 个键\n2.将这些键从原始节点移动到同级节点\n3.更新父节点中原始节点的关键帧，以反映其拆分后的新最大关键帧\n4.将同级节点插入父节点（可能导致父节点也被拆分）\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
